The system specifications are exactly the same as those already implemented for the heat shrink lines area.  In a nutshell:

1.  The forklift is not authorized to enter the area until the light above the 'rope switch' is steady red.  AGVs circulate freely within the 'merchandising' area;
2.  When the forklift wants to enter, the forklift operator pulls the rope switch and (I believe) one of the lights starts flashing (I think it's the green one).  Any AGVs present within that area complete their movements and no other AGVs enter that area;
3.  When the area is free of AGVs, the light turns solid green and the forklift can perform its tasks;
4.

