If the required loading unit cannot be transported because it is physically blocked by another loading unit (LU2), the user can scan LU2 and:

- If LU2 is identical (only LU-ID or PRODUTTORE is different) to LU1:
- o if no transport order exists for LU2, WAMAS will swap LU without asking for confirmation (silent swap LU);
- o If a transport order (TO2) exists for LU2, WAMAS will swap LU and re-locate TO2 to LU1;
- If LU2 is different from LU1:
- o If a transport order (TO2) exists for LU2, WAMAS will ask for Swapping TO;
- o If no transport order exists for LU2, WAMAS will show an error message.

