For depositing a LU, some more options for confirmation are possible:

- if there is another LU on the same location (S01 01-00-00), it can be scanned for confirmation;
- if there is no LU on the target location, another LU can be scanned and WAMAS takes over the first two co-ordinates of this location (S01 01 from the example above) in order to facilitate the manual entry of the lo-cation code (as there are no barcodes to scan).

