 The  'internal  unloading'  can  be  performed  more  than  one  time  for  each  delivery.   At  any  time  of execution, WAMAS must send the record type 25 related to the LU 'internal unloaded' at that time.

 The delivery and all the LUs already picked (no matter where they are: already placed at buffer or staging area independently) are automatically added to a new Truck Load with the following ID:

SXXXXXXXX 000 (S=site, XXXXXXXXX = Progressive number made by the WMS, 000 = fixed value).

 This  Truck  Load  and  therefore  delivery  is  then  closed  and  WAMAS  sends  record  type  25  for  each loaded LU to AS400 plus the 'cap record'.

 Example: DELIVERY NO.  55555:

- LU1 -ready in the buffer;
- LU2 -ready in the buffer;
- LU3 -to be picked;
- LU4 -to be picked.

