metadata.window:
## P90-LEV (Scarico Interno Automatico)

The picking is done as a normal order.  This mode it's a special case automatically made by a job that peri-odically runs the shipping of the LUs located in a particular warehouse location.

 Both the delivery and the location must be enabled to the automatic internal discharge.  The location is a defined WAMAS staging area which acts as a destination for the transport orders.  The system performs loading automatically:

- for pallets staged in a specific location (The location is a defined WAMAS staging area which acts as a destination for the transport orders);
- for orders with special flag TIPO RICHIESTA = L received from HOST;

For automatic unloading no delivery split and Truck Load creation for every LU is done -this would result in too many deliveries and Truck Loads.  Instead, the delivery remains open with the remaining LUs and the record type 25 is sent for the loaded LUs with the created Truck ID only existing in the telegram.  The Truck Load and its ID do not show up in the overview of all the Truck Loads (as with the standard delivery/truck load), it will be entered in the record type 25 (else there would be too much splitting done).

